# Important Safety Checks

Before deleting an EBS volume, always verify:

```text
✓ Correct instance
✓ Correct EBS volume
✓ Correct volume size
✓ Correct device mapping
✓ Mount points identified
✓ Application dependency checked
✓ Required files backed up
✓ S3 backup validated
✓ Filesystems unmounted
✓ Swap disabled if applicable
✓ /etc/fstab reviewed
✓ Volume detached
✓ Final deletion approved
```

Deleting an EBS volume is a destructive operation. The backup and volume-to-device mapping should therefore be validated before deletion.

